  <History Date="13-12-04" Author="Phil Rogers" Comment="Created from v3.2" />
  <History Date="14-12-04" Author="Tom" Comment="Checked" />
  <History Date="04-03-05" Author="Dave Trounce" Comment="Error 1: Could do with merging with other Catalyst personalities." />
  <History Date="05-04-06" Author="Ed" Comment="Changed Aspect Ratio to beam" />
  <History Date="06-04-06" Author="Ed" Comment="Moved all keystoning to Beam group" />
  <History Date="10-04-06" Author="Ed Spencer" Comment="Moved Param 1 and 2 into special group" />
  <History Date="11-04-06" Author="Ed Spencer" Comment="Moved Scale into beam group" />
  <History Date="12-04-06" Author="Ed Spencer" Comment="Moved trail into Effect group and moved visual Effect into effect group" />
  <History Date="02-02-09" Author="D4 Personality Fixer 2009" Comment="Changed Function Names" />
  <History Date="28-09-09" Author="Gregory Haynes" Comment="Changed Dimmer power on value to 0" />
  <History Date="28-01-11" Author="Gregory Haynes" Comment="Updated keystone attributes for Titan attribute control" />
  <History Date="28-01-11" Author="Gregory Haynes" Comment="Merged Catalyst personalities into one file" />
  <History Date="09-02-11" Author="John Rogers" Comment="Edited ranges types in Mask Rotate. Corrected Blue locate value." />
  <History Date="09-02-11" Author="John Rogers" Comment="Corrected Highlight/Lowlight values." />
  <History Date="01-03-11" Author="John Rogers" Comment="Inverted ranges of Keystone X3, Y1 X4 and Y4 attributes." />
  <History Date="01-03-11" Author="John Rogers" Comment="Added Layer Select and Video Switcher modes." />
  <History Date="03-08-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed Gobo size, Scale, xpos and ypos to single 16bit raw range in response to customer." />
  <History Date="03-08-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Removed X Rot update from Y Rot Func.  Adjusted rotate functions.  Increased wheel resolution." />
  <History Date="03-08-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed power on and locate.  Removed non-existant attributes from Colour Eff update." />
  <History Date="03-08-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Removed parameter update from visual eff.  There was nothing to update." />
  <History Date="19-04-12" Author="Locate Fix" Comment="Updated locate, power on, highlight and lowlight values to valid values" />
  <History Date="10-12-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Edited added Raw DMX range to Visual FX and Colour FX." />
  <History Date="10-12-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Put lots of ranges into Library and File channels" />
  <History Date="28-02-13" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Created from High End Catalyst" />
  <History Date="08-05-13" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Updated X,Y,Z Locate value to 32768." />
  <History Date="12-06-13" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Remapped Keystone values to new specs." />
  <History Date="21-06-13" Author="Gregory Haynes" Comment="Updated rotate locate values again, and changed ranges so they occupy the full channel. Adjusted zoom and position locate values. Changed name from AI to Ai." />
  <History Date="20-08-13" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Corrected keystone." />
  <History Date="11-02-14" Author="RGB Power on Updater" Comment="Updated RGB Power on values to match Locate." />
  <History Date="15-01-15" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Changed X/Y channels to Pan/Tilt." />
  <History Date="25-09-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed name from Ai V7 to Ai v7" />
  <History Date="09-02-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail.  Changed hue and saturation ID's for compatibility." />
  <History Date="08-03-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added new improved product thumbnail!" />
  <History Date="02-05-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed Library attribute ID to Folder for compatibility." />
